1A|05 01 02|BCD 1 byte 00 or 01|SET > Connectors > ACC AF/IF Output > AF SQL|(00=OFF (Open), 01=ON)
1A|05 01 03|BCD 1 byte 00 or 01|SET > Connectors > ACC AF/IF Output > AF Beep/Speech... Output|(00=OFF, 01=ON)
